# Content hash of the frozen benchmark set (CLAUDE.md §3.4, §13.7).
# tests/test_pipeline_and_stats.py asserts this matches. A re-freeze must update
# BOTH files in a commit whose message starts with 'REFREEZE:' — the commit-msg hook
# is a control, this hash is the backstop that also runs in CI and after a revert.
# Digest is over LINE-ENDING-NORMALISED bytes (are.util.content_digest), so it
# survives a checkout that rewrites CRLF -> LF.
0acfd27efce608522a2a1bb3cd2e6e999662aa3096209c1a76fac9062542d0c3  frozen_scenarios.json
